$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=dchrgscrt  LOC_AFTER=?

* The CRT factorisation of the Gauss sum (Lean LargeSieve gaussSum_crt, with an explicit Bezout pair A V + B U = 1 in place of the existential unit shifts): the Gauss sum of the product of the characters X mod U and Z mod V induced to ( U x. V ), shifted by C, is the product of the Gauss sum of X shifted by A C and that of Z shifted by B C.

